 PASISOXT:,NAME,
C===========================================================
C PASISOXT - translate one internal character code to its ISO/output
C form; work.p2c calls it directly (`char pasisoxt(textchar) fortran;`,
C used from printErrMsg) through the ordinary Fortran-call marshalling,
C the same as PASMITXT.
C
C This is a verbatim port of the Pascal runtime's PASISOXT
C (paslib/pasisoxt.dtran) -- fully self-contained, no SUBP dependencies.
C Structure and content are otherwise unexamined; the fixpoint check and
C full test suite verify it.
C===========================================================
